# A demand stimulus, as data rather than as a bespoke test harness.
#
# Nothing in Lengnick v1 creates money, so this single line is the whole
# experiment: at month 3000, the issuer account hands every household 50.
# Watch the `total_money` column (money in circulation) step up by 50,000
# while the books stay balanced -- money was created, and nothing was broken.
#
#   ./build/atc --burn-in 1000 --months 6000 \
#       --scenario scenarios/stimulus.scenario --out output/stimulus.csv
#
# Months are counted from the start of the run, burn-in included, so month
# 3000 here is measurement month 2000 in the CSV.

atc-scenario 1
seed 1

3000 issue_all 0 50
